<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:style="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:style:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:table="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:table:1.0" xmlns:fo="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:xsl-fo-compatible:1.0" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text" office:version="1.4">
  <office:styles>
    <style:style style:name="P" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-top="0cm" fo:margin-bottom="0cm"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="10pt"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="FirstPage" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="P">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:break-before="page" fo:text-align="center"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="15pt" fo:font-weight="bold"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="NextPage" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="P">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:break-before="page" fo:text-align="center"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="15pt" fo:font-weight="bold"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Cell" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.5pt solid #000000" fo:padding="0.06cm" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="9pt"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="HeadCell" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.8pt solid #000000" fo:padding="0.06cm" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:text-align="center"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="10pt" fo:font-weight="bold"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="ColA" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="2.3cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="ColB" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="5.2cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="ColC" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="1.7cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="ColD" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="1.6cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="ColE" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="1.8cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="ColF" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="5.2cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="ColWide" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="17.8cm"/>
    </style:style>
  </office:styles>
  <office:automatic-styles>
    <style:page-layout style:name="PageLayout">
      <style:page-layout-properties fo:page-width="21cm" fo:page-height="29.7cm" style:print-orientation="portrait" fo:margin-top="1.2cm" fo:margin-bottom="1.2cm" fo:margin-left="1.2cm" fo:margin-right="1.2cm"/>
    </style:page-layout>
  </office:automatic-styles>
  <office:master-styles>
    <style:master-page style:name="Standard" style:page-layout-name="PageLayout"/>
  </office:master-styles>
  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="FirstPage">避難者卡（正面）　【様式－７】</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="P">避難者カード【中国語（簡体</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="P">填写日　　年　　月　　日　　请每个家庭都填写一张。</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="FrontForm">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColA"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColB"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColC"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColD"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColE"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColF"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>避難日期</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>年　 月　 日　 点左右</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:number-rows-spanned="3" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>居住组 - No</text:p><text:p>1组 - 1 ～ 6</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>避難場所</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>避難所　・　居家　・　其他　（　　　　　　　　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>※在车内住宿避难者请填写停车场的位置。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>自治会名称</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>※如果未加入自治会，写上“未加入”</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>在避難所的人打圈</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>片假名读音</text:p><text:p>姓 名</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>年龄</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>性别</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>关系</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>备注※需要照顾号码 以及需要照顾的地方</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>（代表者）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　岁</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　岁</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　岁</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　岁</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　岁</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>地址</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>〒</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>代表者电话号码</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>（　　　　　　）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>有无宠物</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>有　　・　　无　　　　※选「有」的，请接着填写宠物登记票。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>需要照顾者</text:p><text:p>※请在备注栏填写所需号码</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>1 孕产妇　　2 婴幼儿　　3 残疾人（　　　　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>4 需要护理　　5 使用医疗机械（　　　　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>6 过敏症（　　　　　　　　）　　7 外国人（国籍　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>8 其他（　　　　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>※需要照顾者指孕产妇、婴幼儿、残疾人等在避難生活中需要特别照顾的人士。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>

      <text:p text:style-name="NextPage">避難者カード(背面)　【様式-7】</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="P">背面内容可等状况安定后再填写。</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="BackForm">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColA"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColB"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColC"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColD"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColE"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColF"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>为了确认安否而公开信息（请选择「希望」「不希望」的任意一个，并打○。）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>您同意通过网页或报道机构等公开避難者（您的）信息吗？</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>希望　・　不希望</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>当亲戚、同个住所的人、朋友问及您的安否时，您同意提供避難者（您的）信息吗？</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>希望・不希望</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-rows-spanned="3" table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>房屋受灾状况</text:p><text:p>※请在该当的选项上画圈。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>有　　・　　无　　※选“有”后，请详细填写住房受害状况。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>※填写例</text:p><text:p>・房子倒塌，近期内无法居住。</text:p><text:p>・室内收拾好后，可以回去居住。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>停电　　停水　　煤气断了　　电话不通</text:p><text:p>其他（　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6" table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>伤病者信息</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>请填写姓名和具体的负伤、疾病状况。</text:p><text:p> </text:p><text:p> </text:p><text:p> </text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>收容场所</text:p><text:p>（送往机构）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p> </text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>收容场所信息</text:p><text:p>（送往机构地址）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p> </text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>特記事項（如果有种资格等，可以提供合作的人士，请填写姓名和内容。）</text:p><text:p> </text:p><text:p> </text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="P">＜避難所运营委员会填写栏＞</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="CommitteeForm">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColA"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColB"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColC"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColD"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColE"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColF"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p> </text:p><text:p> </text:p><text:p> </text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>退所年月日</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>年　月　日</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>退出后去向</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p> </text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>电话</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p> </text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="P">为确保避難所的顺利运作，敬请各位避難人员（包括居家避難及车内避難人员）在力所能及的范围内协助参与避難所的管理与运营。</text:p>
    </office:text>
  </office:body>
</office:document>